  "toggles": [],
  "_comment": "Coinbase Wallet extension, plain ETH send. One company answers almost everything: balances, prices, history, profiles, recipient screening, gas, the RPC and the broadcast. Pressing Send asks for the password again; right after, the wallet signs a login message with your key (createAccessTokenForPrimaryAddress) and Coinbase stores the recipient as a used destination. During the send it also polls BTC, LTC, DOGE and Solana indexers for addresses from the same seed. The extension shows a '3.148.0 QA' corner banner; it is the Chrome Web Store build. Real mainnet tx 0x66e61bb9180358b243000292ccf993a53173f40d5068bda00b04083898044c3d.",
